{"schemaVersion":1,"unitId":"u009","words":[{"word":"employee","phonetic":"/ɪmˈplɔɪiː/","meanings":[{"meaning":"雇员，员工","pos":"noun","usage":"指在一家公司或组织工作的人"}]},{"word":"hard-working","phonetic":"/hɑːd ˈwɜːkɪŋ/","meanings":[{"meaning":"勤勉的，工作努力的","pos":"adjective","usage":"形容人工作勤奋认真"}]},{"word":"keyboard","phonetic":"/ˈkiːbɔːd/","meanings":[{"meaning":"键盘","pos":"noun","usage":"电脑或打字机的键盘"}]},{"word":"operator","phonetic":"/ˈɒpəreɪtə/","meanings":[{"meaning":"操作员","pos":"noun","usage":"操作机器或设备的人员"}]},{"word":"sales","phonetic":"/seɪlz/","meanings":[{"meaning":"销售","pos":"noun","usage":"指卖东西的工作或部门"}]},{"word":"representative","phonetic":"/ˌreprɪˈzentətɪv/","meanings":[{"meaning":"代表","pos":"noun","usage":"sales rep 是推销员的缩写形式"}]},{"word":"lazy","phonetic":"/ˈleɪzi/","meanings":[{"meaning":"懒惰的","pos":"adjective","usage":"形容人不愿工作或努力"}]},{"word":"young","phonetic":"/jʌŋ/","meanings":[{"meaning":"年轻的","pos":"adjective","usage":"指年龄小"}]},{"word":"assistant","phonetic":"/əˈsɪstənt/","meanings":[{"meaning":"助手，助理","pos":"noun","usage":"帮助别人工作的人"}]},{"word":"office","phonetic":"/ˈɒfɪs/","meanings":[{"meaning":"办公室","pos":"noun","usage":"工作的地方"}]},{"word":"meet","phonetic":"/miːt/","meanings":[{"meaning":"遇见，见到","pos":"verb","usage":"指第一次见面或相遇"}]},{"word":"busy","phonetic":"/ˈbɪzi/","meanings":[{"meaning":"忙碌的","pos":"adjective","usage":"有很多事情要做的"}]},{"word":"woman","phonetic":"/ˈwʊmən/","meanings":[{"meaning":"女人","pos":"noun","usage":"成年女性的称呼，复数是women"}]},{"word":"man","phonetic":"/mæn/","meanings":[{"meaning":"男人","pos":"noun","usage":"成年男性的称呼，复数是men"}]},{"word":"very","phonetic":"/ˈveri/","meanings":[{"meaning":"非常，很","pos":"adverb","usage":"用于修饰形容词或副词"}]}],"phrases":[{"phrase":"How do you do?","usage":"用于正式场合第一次见面时的问候语","examples":[{"en":"How do you do? Nice to meet you.","zh":"你好，很高兴见到你。"}]},{"phrase":"Come and meet","usage":"邀请他人去见某人","examples":[{"en":"Come and meet our new teacher.","zh":"来见见我们的新老师。"}]},{"phrase":"What are their jobs?","usage":"询问多个人的工作","examples":[{"en":"What are their jobs? They are doctors.","zh":"他们的工作是什么？他们都是医生。"}]},{"phrase":"This is...","usage":"介绍某人时使用的句型","examples":[{"en":"This is Tom and this is Jerry.","zh":"这是汤姆，这是杰瑞。"}]},{"phrase":"Who is this...","usage":"询问某人是谁","examples":[{"en":"Who is this young man?","zh":"这个年轻人是谁？"}]},{"phrase":"very hard-working","usage":"非常勤奋的，形容人工作努力","examples":[{"en":"My mother is very hard-working.","zh":"我妈妈工作非常努力。"}]},{"phrase":"office assistant","usage":"办公室助理","examples":[{"en":"He is our office assistant.","zh":"他是我们的办公室助理。"}]},{"phrase":"keyboard operators","usage":"电脑操作员，指操作电脑工作的人","examples":[{"en":"They are keyboard operators.","zh":"他们是电脑操作员。"}]},{"phrase":"sales reps","usage":"销售代表，推销员的简称","examples":[{"en":"The sales reps are very busy.","zh":"销售代表们非常忙。"}]},{"phrase":"Thank you","usage":"表示感谢的礼貌用语","examples":[{"en":"Thank you, Mr. Jackson.","zh":"谢谢您，杰克逊先生。"}]}],"grammar":[{"title":"特殊疑问句 - What 引导的询问工作","structure":"What + are/is + 主语 + jobs?","definition":"用What询问某人的职业或工作 用于询问一个人或多人的职业","examples":[{"en":"What are their jobs?","zh":"他们的工作是什么？"},{"en":"What is her job?","zh":"她的工作是什么？"},{"en":"What are your jobs?","zh":"你们的工作是什么？"}]},{"title":"特殊疑问句 - Who 引导的询问身份","structure":"Who is this + (形容词) + (名词)?","definition":"用Who询问某人是谁 用于询问某人的身份或名字","examples":[{"en":"Who is this young man?","zh":"这个年轻人是谁？"},{"en":"Who is that woman?","zh":"那个女人是谁？"}]},{"title":"特殊疑问句 - How 引导的问候","structure":"How do you do?","definition":"How do you do? 是正式场合的问候语 第一次见面时的正式问候，回答也是 How do you do?","examples":[{"en":"How do you do?","zh":"你好（幸会）。"},{"en":"How do you do? Nice to meet you.","zh":"你好，幸会。很高兴认识你。"}]}],"patterns":[{"pattern":"What are their jobs?","original":{"en":"What are their jobs?","zh":"他们的工作是什么？"},"imitations":[{"en":"What are your jobs?","zh":"你们的工作是什么？"},{"en":"What are the men's jobs?","zh":"这些男士的工作是什么？"}]},{"pattern":"This is + 人名","original":{"en":"This is Michael Baker.","zh":"这是迈克尔·贝克。"},"imitations":[{"en":"This is Tom.","zh":"这是汤姆。"},{"en":"This is our teacher, Miss Wang.","zh":"这是我们的老师，王老师。"}]},{"pattern":"Who is this + (形容词) + (名词)?","original":{"en":"Who is this young man?","zh":"这个年轻人是谁？"},"imitations":[{"en":"Who is this tall woman?","zh":"这个高个子的女人是谁？"},{"en":"Who is that old man?","zh":"那个老人是谁？"}]},{"pattern":"主语 + be + 形容词.","original":{"en":"They are very lazy.","zh":"他们非常懒惰。"},"imitations":[{"en":"She is very hard-working.","zh":"她工作非常努力。"},{"en":"We are very busy.","zh":"我们非常忙。"}]}]}